# scenes on the Arrange page: a second scene cloned, a mute; while playing a white key waits for the bar (again: now),
# SEL's SCENES SWITCH at the pattern's end: a key waits for track 1's end; the song
wait 200
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
expect scene 2
wait 40
shot scene2.png
tapkey b0
wait 40
shot scene2_mute.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
tapkey w0
wait 40
expect scene 2
shot scene_cue_bar.png
wait 2500
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect scene 1
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect scene 2
tap SEL
turn ALGO 1
wait 40
shot scene_switch_list.png
tap HOME
tapkey w0
wait 40
expect scene 2
shot scene_cue.png
wait 2500
expect scene 1
tap SEL
turn ALGO -1
tap HOME
tap PLAY
# holding a scene's key asks CLEAR SCENE?; another scene's key, or that key again, is no
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
tapkey w0
key w1 up
wait 40
expect ask 0
expect scene 2
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
key w1 up
tapkey w1
wait 40
expect ask 0
expect scene 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Song
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w1
wait 40
shot song_slots.png
tap SEL
wait 40
shot song_list.png
tap HOME
turn K1 -5
tap PLAY
wait 1500
shot song_playing.png
tap PLAY
# Mix: a black key held solos, a tap mutes
tap GLO
key b2 down
wait 900
expect mute 1019
shot mix_solo.png
key b2 up
wait 40
expect mute 0
tapkey b1
wait 40
expect mute 2
shot mix_mute.png
# Mix: two black keys held solo both; one let go, the other stays soloed; both let go, the mutes as they were
key b1 down
key b2 down
wait 900
expect mute 1017
key b1 up
wait 40
expect mute 1019
key b2 up
wait 40
expect mute 2
